Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.98,0:00:03.48,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,475)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 4:43 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:05.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's open. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you in the corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you asked me over here, you\Ndidn't say you were in panic mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Koichi, I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the grasp of an\Nenemy's stand. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand's here? Where is it? What's it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn thing adhered itself to my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying there's a\Nstand attached to your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a very serious dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.38,0:00:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I see what we're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.12,0:00:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you don't show it to\Nme, how am I supposed to...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I expose my back, it'll\Nkill me and take hold of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now burn the pages. Yes. Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even as we speak, it's\Nwhispering in my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.28,0:00:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not making sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is all some big\Njoke at my expense, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just told you if I expose\Nmy back, I'm done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I heard you, but how do I know you're\Nnot pulling my leg like you always do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.91,0:01:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit the nail on the head, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm being completely serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a corpse upstairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real dead body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.11,0:01:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Rohan-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.10,0:01:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that,\Njust bow on past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Koichi, you have to see the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.68,0:01:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me what all this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.70,0:01:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.64,0:01:34.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.60,0:01:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did it just disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Koichi, he's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see? It's the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.22,0:01:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Masazo Kinoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After he died, he turned\Ninto a lifeless husk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.96,0:01:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's some really impressive work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this isn't the time\Nto be messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:01:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I'm with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those stand users the old man and the\Nphoto made are trying to hunt us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason I rushed\Nall the way over here was
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.26,0:02:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I was worried\Nsomething happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.24,0:02:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.30,0:02:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.25,0:02:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Koichi, don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.90,0:02:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked you to come here\Nbecause I knew those pieces of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shit Josuke and Okuyasu would\Njust laugh at my predicament!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to trust me, I\Nthought we were friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keicho!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.98,0:02:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheer up, bucko, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.66,0:02:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disappointment's just\Nanother part of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.56,0:02:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been so thoroughly humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard, you're going to pay dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:02:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
