Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.44,0:03:37.94,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&H43E0B6&}sore wa mamori nuku hikari
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.26,0:03:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let the voice of love take you higher.
