Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.95,0:03:49.29,Part 4 OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}{\1c&H71FFF9&}atsumaru chikara de tokisae koete
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.48,0:03:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the power of the stars.
