Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.47,0:04:09.89,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,475)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 5:25 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My nails are going through their\Nsignature growth spurt again,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.39,0:04:13.23,Thoughts,Kira,0,0,0,,{\an8}Recently, my nails have been growing too quickly.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.98,0:04:15.48,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,890)\fs60}Episode 34: {\fs80} July 15th (Thursday), Part 4
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.98,0:04:15.48,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,890)\fs60}Episode 34: {\fs80} July 15th (Thursday) Part 4
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's no wonder why.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.23,0:04:14.81,Thoughts,Kira,0,0,0,,{\an8}Much too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way your hands run through that\Nperfectly coiffed hair is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've nearly escaped death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least until I fully\Ntransitioned to Kosaku Kawajiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My old man's such a pest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.86,0:04:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't leave the house without\Nthe Cursed Kodger following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even caught him spying on me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.68,0:04:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he thinks you're\Nout partying too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whose fault would it be if I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so pissed at him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided to freak him out by shoplifting\Nright in front of his saggy face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.56,0:04:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I made a beeline to your\Nplace, which I'm sure set him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're insane, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cops are probably after you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.91,0:04:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.83,0:04:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea\Ntouching people's bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:04:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:05:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You a pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.35,0:05:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or just a damn pickpocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mariah! Mariah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we're already in Mariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow! That freaking hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it where you're walking, jerk-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see what he was carrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a bowling pin nail clipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of breed carries\Naround something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you say lame?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:36.98,0:05:39.94,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,395)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 5:07 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got the pictures, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the Mariah Grand Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.20,0:06:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your best bet is to call it\Nquits and burn the pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all while someone could have\Nbeen watching from a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was very risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.44,0:06:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At some point, almost every\Nstreet comes to an intersection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.37,0:06:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone will take a peek at your\Nback, so crossing's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since the road is about to\Nget wider, that means more people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.98,0:06:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's stop all this and go back, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're never going to\Nmake it across the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masazo Kinoto made it\Nto my house, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd have had to cross\Nan intersection to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can pull it off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to know how he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha! Like this!
