Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.62,0:06:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This certainly isn't my most shining\Nmoment, but it'll get me across.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad, Rohan Kishibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's something you\Nhaven't thought about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:07:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Masazo Kinoto was crossing the street,\NI stayed as quiet as a church mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, dumb shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you farting along like some slug?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.02,0:07:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, why don't you turn\Naround and find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only one who's missing\Nsomething here, Cheap Trap, is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have something Masazo didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand, heaven's door!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.25,0:07:20.50,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: I cannot turn around for one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.16,0:07:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?! Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.14,0:07:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that that's settled, I\Ncan get to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.46,0:07:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you prepare yourself. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.46,0:07:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you'll never make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When this is over, you'll be a\Nshriveled up limp dick of a corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure talk a good game, but\Nthat's all you're good at, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't be saying anything soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WHO THE HELL DO YOU THINK\NYOU'RE TALKING TO, BITCH?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.03,0:07:51.74,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,689)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 5:32 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems there won't be any\Nmajor intersections for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know if your heaven's door\Nworks on animals? Huh? Huh? Do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it works on any intelligent\Nanimal. Well, in that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if an animal sees your back, it stands to\Nreason I'll be able to transfer to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much easier than people, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'll have to be\Njust as careful around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, I hate these creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.20,0:08:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their glare is infuriating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right cat, beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're swarming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it takes is a quick glance from\Nany one of these little guys, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right when you said the only\Nthing I'm good at is talking, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.74,0:08:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But humans aren't the only\Nliving things I can talk to!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.70,0:08:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I summoned those animals here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they are not happy givers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just finished telling them that\Nyou love killing cats and dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So imagine what they think!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sick 'em, buds!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are too many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.76,0:09:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These animals didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to get lost, all of you. Shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sound belongs to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keicho! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were fooling me like always?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I had this nagging feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I went back to your house and\Nfound you acting just as weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when you got outside, you were\Nstill skulking around the sidewalk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with your back against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's how you crossed the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were telling the truth about\Nthe stand stuck to your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why I admire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.52,0:09:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the real deal, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A true blue friend to the\Nvery end. It's on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So all we have to do is remove that\Nparasite and we're good to go, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reverb!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.17,0:10:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special Ability 3! Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.56,0:10:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm clinging to you with my special\Nability and not brute strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try to rip me off, you'll just end\Nup destroying your back in the process.
