Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.64,0:10:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell Koichi, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you better hurry and spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, Rohan-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful to you, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that you would help\Nme has truly touched my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd appreciate it if\Nyou'd withdraw act three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't see it from there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it would seem my back is\Nstarting to rip itself open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Act three, withdraw three\Nfrees on the double.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,S-H-I-T! Withdraw completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:10:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay, Rohan sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.98,0:10:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How bad does it look, Koichi Hirose?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the reason he's in this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand now, Rohan,\Nyou can't remove me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.76,0:11:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can try to tear me\Noff by force if you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you'll end up tearing off\Nyour own back along the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're just going\Nto exhaust yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder, will you collapse\Nfrom the trauma and fatigue?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or will you go insane and kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.78,0:11:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the most powerful\Nstan in the world couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beat this weaklings gift for\Ngab and utter domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stan that clings to backs!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.66,0:11:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is too bizarre!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bizarre. So true. Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.34,0:11:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to give you a peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's finally lost his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you realize a visit\Nto Jotaro would be futile!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never had any intention\Nof ever paying him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.02,0:12:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was my destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was beside myself\Nthat I finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help but laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the rambling?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally exposed your\Nback to another soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get to pass into Koichi Hirose!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this street!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where we met!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheap trap, you picked a hell\Nof a place to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you had known about this\Nplace and resisted turning around,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would have still had no\Nchoice but to look Koichi's way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.22,0:12:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thanks to your special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:12:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're walking down Rainy Street!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking back's a death wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right about no stand being\Nable to remove you from my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd just end up hurting me if you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, there is something\Nthat can take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.00,0:13:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something that latches on to\Nthose who dare to look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.50,0:13:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something that'll carry\Naway your very soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.44,0:13:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me go, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are these things gonna take me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.38,0:13:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.48,0:13:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.24,0:13:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't say for sure whether\Nthere's a heaven or a hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.44,0:13:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but a simple memo should do the trick.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.83,0:13:38.83,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: I'm going to burn in Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a stand that does nothing but talk,\Nhe was quite a little terror, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.26,0:13:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't have shown up when you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.16,0:13:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I wouldn't still\Nbe around to tell the tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no clue this is where we ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too focused on\Nthat freaky enemy stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Reimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.74,0:14:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you take these pictures? Yes. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
