Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.00,0:14:27.17,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,559)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 6:04 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.16,0:14:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.30,0:14:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mika got her boyfriend to buy her a\Nbrand new pair of designer earrings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.76,0:14:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say you buy me some?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.68,0:14:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell you think you're doing, skis?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my apartment!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm... A studio apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you be so kind as\Nto tell me your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't look normal, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.04,0:15:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look how long they've gotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think there's a single soul on the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,planet who can keep\Ntheir nails from growing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can stop a nail's destiny to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as there's no one who can truly\Nsuppress the inner passions one is born with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.94,0:15:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I believe I asked\Nyou to tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.48,0:15:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do to my boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was right here before...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.78,0:15:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever answer a\Nquestion with a question!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did learn proper etiquette while\Nyou were in school now, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking you to tell\Nme what your name is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minako!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.11,0:15:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Minako!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful name your\Nparents bestowed upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minako, I have a little request. If\Nyou don't mind, I would be thrilled if
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:16:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could hold on to these for me and\NI'd greatly appreciate it if you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trim my robust nails with these lame\Nclippers you've never done this before
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have you it's your lucky day now don't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cut them too short someone help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me! Forgive you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the least bit angry if\Nthat's what's concerning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You intrigue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I chose you because of our connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was born with a certain set of desires,\Nso I simply try to make the most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life's better that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were begging your boyfriend\Nfor a pair of earrings, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He left these for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.08,0:16:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You truly are a deft nail-cutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How I adore you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare say you're even\Ncuter when you're silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what to do now, my dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to take you back home with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't think the\NKawajiris would approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how I've missed the sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.18,0:17:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that man and woman he\Nfollowed here from the station,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he completely vaporized them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.67,0:17:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could he be doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is in the opposite direction\Nfrom the house and school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.92,0:17:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I forgot to lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could Hayato have?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he's human.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that demon pretending to be my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might be evidence that he's returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure this is blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Kira's finally made his move.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.39,0:18:51.73,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,650)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 8:36 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.80,0:18:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hayato is holding a\Nvideo camera in his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem to be\Nanywhere in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.88,0:19:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've definitely noticed\NHayato acting strange lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.68,0:19:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that boy up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to calm down. Breathe, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down and gather your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I need to deal with this tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I show it to someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.30,0:19:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.84,0:19:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has complete and\Ntotal faith in the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I show it to the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.60,0:19:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would they believe that I witnessed a\Nman being vaporized right in front of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.94,0:19:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not a normal human!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.86,0:19:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could the police even\Ncatch someone like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.48,0:19:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone in the world who has what\Nit takes to catch a monster like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.56,0:19:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.04,0:19:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, he's\Ngonna kill Mom and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.02,0:20:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any room in there left for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can dear old dad join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.26,0:20:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the odd face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.76,0:20:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.10,0:20:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I was actually just\Nfinishing up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.70,0:20:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should do some bonding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.88,0:20:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he finds this tape, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to be a bother, but I'll need\Nto use that bucket for the bath. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to wash the long\Nday away with some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we're bonding, I'll\Nwash your back for you, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.02,0:20:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a splendid idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, please allow me to\Nwash your back first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been in the bath for\Na while, so it's only fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can just take turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sweating like a guilty\Nlittle pig ripe for slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.60,0:21:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or did the heat get to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at the way you're shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.84,0:21:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd be rather odd for a person to tremble\Nafter being in the bath for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cut it out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.14,0:21:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't touch my back\Nthere because I freak out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only told you a million times!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How silly of me. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always were a ticklish one, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.44,0:21:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the front myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to lend you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I wanted to\Ntalk to you about something.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.33,0:21:59.04,Main,Kira,0,0,0,,{\an8}This evening, I was in the Zyouzenji area in the opposite direction from home...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.33,0:21:59.04,Main,Kira,0,0,0,,{\an8}This evening, I was in the Jozenji area in the opposite direction from home...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was doing some work errands in the\Nopposite end of town near Jozenji,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.68,0:22:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I happened to see you.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.04,0:22:00.59,Main,Kira,0,0,0,,{\an8}...and I saw you there...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you were holding a video camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.92,0:22:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could you have been doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.16,0:22:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.82,0:22:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew this sleuthing\Nshit was spying on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.56,0:22:17.81,Thoughts,Kira,0,0,0,,{\an8}How could this have happened?\N I thought I could peacefully blend in with this household...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.54,0:22:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for casually\Nassimilating into this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.56,0:22:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been one catastrophe after another.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.81,0:22:19.98,Thoughts,Kira,0,0,0,,{\an8}This year has been filled with nothing but misfortune...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A year of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing this punk will cause a\Ncommotion, and a bad one at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.54,0:22:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he saw everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.88,0:22:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A strand of this brat's hair\Nnow functions as a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All it'll take is a\Nsmall blast to his skull,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.00,0:22:41.04,Thoughts,Kira,0,0,0,,{\an8}If I create a small explosion near his head,\N it will appear as if he slipped and hit his head on the hard floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.54,0:22:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it'll appear he simply\Nslipped and bumped his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People slip and fall in\Nthe bathroom all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.38,0:22:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's time for you to die.\NSo you're gonna kill me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look around pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.40,0:22:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm recording everything that's happening
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:22:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never trusted you. fraud!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.10,0:23:00.48,Main,Hayato,0,0,0,,{\an8}I've been suspicious of you for a long time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.06,0:23:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've recorded all your weird shoe sizes\Nand signature practice accessions.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.48,0:23:04.36,Main,Hayato,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your shoes not fitting and the time you spent practicing your signature are all on video!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I taped that cat plant\Nliving in the attic, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.16,0:23:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only I know where all the tapes are, but\Nif something terrible were to happen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone would\Nfind them eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.80,0:23:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you get off?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.26,0:23:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna lay a finger on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.26,0:23:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you could\Nthreaten the likes of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.58,0:23:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that goes double for Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break it down.
